WEBVTT

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:33.810
(Applause)

00:10:34.532 --> 00:10:35.731
You know, to me,

00:10:35.755 --> 00:10:39.976
human communities depend
upon a diversity of talent,

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.456
not a singular conception of ability.

00:10:42.928 --> 00:10:44.905
And at the heart of our challenges --

00:10:44.929 --> 00:10:47.570
(Applause)

00:10:47.594 --> 00:10:48.976
At the heart of the challenge

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.971
is to reconstitute our sense of ability
and of intelligence.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.703
This linearity thing is a problem.

00:10:56.154 --> 00:10:58.976
When I arrived in L.A.
about nine years ago,

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:03.129
I came across a policy statement --